{
	"name": "Fungal Domination",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/magic/nature/mushroom-glow-red.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>Beginning at 14th level, you gain immunity to poison damage while you are frenzied.</p><p>Additionally, when you are under the effects of your Blood Frenzy and you hit a creature with your Sanguine Transference, you may attempt to impart a form of fungal mind-control to connect the two of you on a mental level. The triggering creature must make a Wisdom saving throw versus your maneuver DC. On a success, the creature is immune to your Fungal Domination feature for 24 hours. On a failure, the creature is subjected to the effects of your Frenzy until the end of its next turn, but it views you as a member of its fungal network and instead attacks the next closest creature that is not you. Once you have used this ability, you may not do so again until you complete a short or a long rest.</p>",
